    "introduction": "Prudential provides life and health insurance and asset-management services with a focus on Asia and Africa. Its products help customers protect income, pay for healthcare and build longer-term savings. Distribution through agents, banks and other channels connects the business with households in markets that have different insurance needs and levels of financial development. Revenue and earnings depend on policies sold, existing customer relationships and the management of long-term commitments. The business combines local distribution with group-level investment and risk capabilities. Economic conditions, healthcare costs, customer retention and regulatory capital requirements influence performance across the countries in which it operates.",
